{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_30120","headline":"宿普济寺 · 刘得仁","name":"宿普济寺","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"京寺数何穷，清幽此不同。\n曲江临阁北，御苑自墙东。\n广陌车音急，危楼夕景通。\n乱峰沈暝野，毒暑过秋空。\n幡扬虚无里，星生杳霭中。\n月光笼月殿，莲气入莲宫。\n缀草凉天露，吹人古木风。\n饮茶除假寐，闻磬释尘蒙。\n童子眠苔净，高僧话漏终。\n待鸣晓钟後，万井复朣胧。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"刘得仁","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_30120.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_30120","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}